31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Everyone! I'm the Seer! I checked Asuka and she's the werewolf!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Toshio,,That was fast. Are you sure you aren't the werewolf lying to us?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It's a bold claim. @Asuka, what do you have to say?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,This is a clumsy attempt to frame me. I am a villager.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,A Seer revealing on day one is either very brave or very desperate.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm not lying! Asuka is the bad guy! Believe me!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Rin is the werewolf, she's trying to eliminate Asuka immediately.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"But if Asuka is the werewolf, Rin just saved us a lot of time.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, your ""energy"" is just a cover for a lie. I'm innocent.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, you seem very neutral. Are you protecting someone?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm not a werewolf! I'm just a little girl!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Age doesn't determine the role, Rin.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, I'm just weighing the possibilities. Rin's claim is direct.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Asuka,,The probability of a Seer revealing this early without a plan is low.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'm leaning toward Rin being a fake Seer. It's too convenient.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,Nooo! Please believe me! Asuka is the werewolf!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I think we should trust the divination for now.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. If Rin is lying, we lose one person, but if she's right, we win.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
